{"id":"b79b2210e4f56178","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-metric-homeomorphism-map.md","title":"ZFC Metric Homeomorphism Map","display":"df-zfc-metric-homeomorphism-map — ZFC Metric Homeomorphism Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-metric-homeomorphism-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-metric-homeomorphism-map"],"display":"df-zfc-metric-homeomorphism-map — ZFC Metric Homeomorphism Map","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch16/58-df-metric-space]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-metric-homeomorphism-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-metric-homeomorphism-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-metric-homeomorphism-map — ZFC Metric Homeomorphism Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ce876585d129ce97\" href=\"?note=ce876585d129ce97\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-metric-space\">../batch16/58-df-metric-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,d_X,d_Y,f\\in V\">\\(X,Y,d_X,d_Y,f\\in V\\)</span> (metric carriers, metrics, and map graph)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S\\)</span> (metric-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ce876585d129ce97\" href=\"?note=ce876585d129ce97\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-metric-space\">../batch16/58-df-metric-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMetricHomeomorphismMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMetricHomeomorphismMap}_S\\)</span> (homeomorphism predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}metric\\text{-}homeomorphism\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMetricHomeomorphismMap}_S(f,X,Y,d_X,d_Y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d_X)\\land\n\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(Y,d_Y)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall x,x&#39;\\in X\\;(f(x)=f(x&#39;)\\to x=x&#39;)\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall y\\in Y\\;\\exists x\\in X\\;(f(x)=y)\\bigr)\\land\n\\Bigl(\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\forall x&#39;\\in X\\;(d_X(x,x&#39;)&lt;\\delta\\to d_Y(f(x),f(x&#39;))&lt;\\varepsilon)\\Bigr)\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\forall x&#39;\\in X\\;(d_Y(f(x),f(x&#39;))&lt;\\delta\\to d_X(x,x&#39;)&lt;\\varepsilon)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}metric\\text{-}homeomorphism\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMetricHomeomorphismMap}_S(f,X,Y,d_X,d_Y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d_X)\\land\n\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(Y,d_Y)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall x,x&#39;\\in X\\;(f(x)=f(x&#39;)\\to x=x&#39;)\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall y\\in Y\\;\\exists x\\in X\\;(f(x)=y)\\bigr)\\land\n\\Bigl(\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\forall x&#39;\\in X\\;(d_X(x,x&#39;)&lt;\\delta\\to d_Y(f(x),f(x&#39;))&lt;\\varepsilon)\\Bigr)\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\forall x&#39;\\in X\\;(d_Y(f(x),f(x&#39;))&lt;\\delta\\to d_X(x,x&#39;)&lt;\\varepsilon)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The last two clauses formalize continuity of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> and of its inverse without hiding either metric.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-metric-space","status":"resolved","id":"ce876585d129ce97","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-metric-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-metric-space","status":"resolved","id":"ce876585d129ce97","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S$ (metric-space predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-metric-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y,d_X,d_Y,f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMetricHomeomorphismMap}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}metric\\text{-}homeomorphism\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMetricHomeomorphismMap}_S(f,X,Y,d_X,d_Y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d_X)\\land\n\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(Y,d_Y)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall x,x'\\in X\\;(f(x)=f(x')\\to x=x')\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall y\\in Y\\;\\exists x\\in X\\;(f(x)=y)\\bigr)\\land\n\\Bigl(\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\n\\forall x'\\in X\\;(d_X(x,x')<\\delta\\to d_Y(f(x),f(x'))<\\varepsilon)\\Bigr)\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\n\\forall x'\\in X\\;(d_Y(f(x),f(x'))<\\delta\\to d_X(x,x')<\\varepsilon)","display":true},{"tex":"f","display":false}],"bytes":1546,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2687","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-metric-homeomorphism-map.md|58-df-zfc-metric-homeomorphism-map]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","ce876585d129ce97","36d7463d215be751"]}